{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-27T20:26:55.997Z","author":"pm-github","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.2-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"2e85054542858d5d8942702e","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.2-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Problem\n\nThe gated sync runs the caller's `post-import-script` (default `changelog:full`) and commits the regenerated `CHANGELOG.md` in the sync PR. Each sync PR therefore edits the same `## Unreleased` hunk as every other open PR in the repository. Merging any of them makes the others conflict or fail `changelog:check`. The regenerated file is also where reviewers find real regressions that have nothing to do with the imported issues.\n\nOpen sync PRs on 2026-11-27, with Sourcery findings in `CHANGELOG.md` only:\n\n- pm-beads#233 and pm-presets#219: \"Dependency updates disappear from changelog\"\n- pm-brief#224: the same, plus duplicate records\n- pm-web#344: \"Current release disappears from changelog\"\n- pm-ops#332: \"Closure appears under wrong date\"\n\npm-glossary#47, pm-web#344, pm-vcs#217, pm-vcs#211, pm-swarm#81 and pm-slack-standup#202 also have red or dirty checks from the same drift.\n\n## Proposal (after pm-changelog#384 is released)\n\npm-changelog#384 makes `changelog:check` treat the `Unreleased` section as pending, so a PR no longer has to commit its own changelog entry. Once that is released:\n\n- the gated sync commits **only tracker files** (`.agents/pm/**`) plus any declared `generated-paths`;\n- the `post-import-script` default becomes empty;\n- when a caller still passes `changelog:full`, the sync warns once that the step is redundant and skips writing `CHANGELOG.md`, or the input is deprecated with a clear notice;\n- the next release regenerates `CHANGELOG.md` as it does today.\n\nThe closeout workflow should do the same if it also regenerates `CHANGELOG.md`.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- A sync of a real fixture repository with two open sibling PRs produces a PR that changes no `CHANGELOG.md`. After one sibling merges, the sync PR and the other sibling both stay mergeable.\n- The caller's `changelog:check` passes on the sync PR with pm-changelog ≥ the #384 release.\n- The README and the workflow input docs explain the change. The template caller and the migration note for callers that pass `post-import-script` explicitly are updated.\n- Every new behaviour has a test that fails on revert.\n\nBlocked by unbraind/pm-changelog#384."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-github-github-ee4d59c27b67-295"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Gated sync commits a regenerated CHANGELOG.md in every sync PR; once pm-changelog treats Unreleased as pending, commit tracker files only"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GH issue #295: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/issues/295 · author @unbraind · created 2026-11-27T10:45:12Z · updated 2026-11-27T10:45:48Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["gh:unbraind/pm-github#295","github_author:unbraind"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-27T20:26:55.997Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-27T20:26:55.997Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pm-github"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"5f599d793ed00a4b46c86fc5e9495fe89a264e49d90d6db78aa08d2cd1c4b70d","item_hash_version":3,"message":"Imported from GitHub #295","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"4850aeab9104dfe1e59d9ddcc7cfdab69555f0817f8edb09049e914a43da7ab1"}
